and memory maintenance processes specifically, above and beyond the effect of participants' attentional state.\nL242: The results suggest that TSD may impair a range of higher-order cognitive processes directly, not just fundamental processes such as attention, and that interventions that benefit attention may have limited scope. (PsycINFO Database Record (c) 2020 APA, all rights reserved).\nL243: 【17†PubMed Disclaimer】\nL244: ## MeSH terms\nL245: \nL246:   * [Button: Adolescent ]\nL247: \nL248: Actions\nL249: \nL250:     * 【18†Search in PubMed】\nL251:     * 【19†Search in MeSH†www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】\nL252:     * 【3†Add to Search】\nL253: \nL254:   * [Button: Adult ]\nL255: \nL256: Actions\nL257: \nL258:     * 【20†Search in PubMed】\nL259:     * 【21†Search in MeSH†www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】\nL260:     * 【3†Add to Search】\nL261: \nL262:   * [Button: Attention / physiology* ]\nL263: \nL264: Actions\nL265: \nL266:     * 【22†Search in PubMed】\nL267:     * 【23†Search in MeSH†www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】\nL268:     * 【3†Add to Search】\nL269: \nL270:   * [Button: Female ]\nL271: \nL272: Actions\nL273:     * 【24†Search in PubMed】\nL274:     * 【25†Search in MeSH†www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】\nL275:     * 【3†Add to Search】\nL276: \nL277:   * [Button: Humans ]\nL278: \nL279: Actions\nL280: \nL281:     * 【26†Search in PubMed】\nL282:     * 【27†Search in MeSH†www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】\nL283:     * 【3†Add to Search】\nL284: \nL285:   * [Button: Male ]\nL286: \nL287: Actions\nL288: \nL289:     * 【28†Search in PubMed】\nL290:     * 【29†Search in MeSH†www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】\nL291:     * 【3†Add to Search】\nL292: \nL293:   * [Button: Neuropsychological Tests ]\nL294: \nL295: Actions\nL296: \nL297:     * 【30†Search in PubMed】\nL298:     * 【31†Search in MeSH†www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】\nL299:     * 【3†Add to Search】\nL300:   * [Button: Psychomotor Performance / physiology* ]\nL301: \nL302: Actions\nL303: \nL304:     * 【32†Search in PubMed】\nL305:     * 【33†Search in MeSH†www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov】\nL306:     * 【3†Add to Search】\